    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "A critical power unit failed, jeopardizing households across the Visayas region where families face power insecurity during a heat crisis. The grid guardian responsible for keeping power flowing to families sounded a red alert to protect residents from grid collapse. Officials implemented emergency load shedding as a control action to prevent a wider collapse, but this emergency measure could not prevent over 950 megawatts of supply from being lost, leaving households without reliable power.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Caregiver",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-1",
          "how-2",
          "result-0"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.9
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "Dangerous seasonal heat pushed demand to the brink, exposing families to load shedding while plants whose outages left communities exposed to blackouts compounded the supply deficit. The power system controller, in an emergency response, declared a red alert for the affected area. This action was followed by emergency load shedding ordered to prevent line overload, a grid stabilization effort that resulted in significant power capacity lost.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Caregiver",
        "fragments": [
          "why-2",
          "why-1",
          "how-1",
          "how-2",
          "result-0"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.85
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "The generator failure that triggered the crisis was Unit 2 tripping offline, an equipment failure that began a chain of events. The grid operator managing the crisis response declared a red alert for the island group placed under red alert. Authorities then ordered load shedding was implemented to keep the critical transmission line from overloading, an emergency measure that led to a massive energy deficit of more than 950 megawatts unavailable.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Caregiver",
